Package: simple-ca
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Simple Certificate Authority
 Installs simple-ca, a single executable that creates and manages a root CA
 and its issuing CAs, issues server and user certificates, signs certificate
 signing requests, writes PKCS#12 bundles, revokes certificates and writes
 CRLs, keeping its records in an index.txt shared with openssl ca.
 .
 The package adds the system user simple-ca and the CA directory
 /etc/simple-ca, the service simple-ca.service, which serves the CA
 certificates and CRLs over HTTP, and the timer simple-ca-crl.timer, which
 renews the CRLs daily. Neither is enabled on installation.
